      "content": "he's being really difficult with the Pedialyte, he just spits it out. i actually have some salt tablets in our first aid kit from when we went hiking... would it be okay if i just crushed one up and mixed it into his juice or something to get his salt levels back up fast? i feel like he needs something stronger than just juice.",
